Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 12:58:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(weekly-load): deliver weekly load policy and classroom
 customization (port of b522ff0)

Ports the Weekly Load / Classroom Customization feature from the final
stable source (arena/01a10437-jadwalv2 @ b522ff0fe40a03a804146ded4bff3e9b5374afcc,
the head of PR #132) onto the Windows 10/11 branch while preserving every
Windows 10/11 specific:

- Flutter stable channel, dependencies and pubspec.lock untouched
- FileSaveService-based save/export handling kept
- lib/main_windows.dart entry point, installer, signing and Windows 10/11
  workflows kept; only the Windows CI gets a pull_request trigger for
  this branch plus analyze/test result annotations

Feature content (byte-identical to the source of truth unless noted):
- Classroom gains weeklyLessonsOverride / dailyPeriodsOverride with the
  same Isar collection id (additive schema only, no migration)
- Unified weekday mapping (0 = Sunday .. 6 = Saturday) via
  timetableDayLabels across Timetable, PDF and Excel exports
- SmartAutoFix honors per-day period caps (30 lessons -> [6,6,6,6,6])
- settings/classrooms/first-run setup UI for the weekly load policy and
  the editable official plan

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
